The shipped salaries and amounts are all distinct, so the baseline `numeric_sum` values cannot reveal this. A column sum over the distinct set undercounts duplicates, and a boolean column of `yes,yes,no` would report `1.0`. That is a real defect in `summarize_file`, and it sits on the boolean path, so I'll fix it with a per-row running sum.
